339
00:26:50.242 --> 00:26:51.141
Sara!

340
00:26:52.143 --> 00:26:53.010
Let's go!

341
00:26:55.246 --> 00:26:57.081
Aye, come on, get up!

342
00:26:58.817 --> 00:26:59.883
