343
00:27:04.789 --> 00:27:06.924
Come on, nella, let's go!

344
00:27:14.232 --> 00:27:15.332
Let's go, Sara.

345
00:27:15.334 --> 00:27:16.767
Got to get up.

346
00:27:23.074 --> 00:27:24.041
Yo, get up!

347
00:27:25.143 --> 00:27:28.679
Mali, come on, up
and at 'em, let's go!

348
00:27:52.270 --> 00:27:53.370
