we pray they don't pick you.

400
00:30:41.340 --> 00:30:43.507
- I'm not sure
praying will help.

401
00:30:43.509 --> 00:30:45.542
- Let's go, let's go!

402
00:30:45.544 --> 00:30:46.476
- Let's go.

403
00:30:46.478 --> 00:30:48.478
- Let's go.

