Yeah.

434
00:32:24.108 --> 00:32:25.509
- How are you today?

435
00:32:25.511 --> 00:32:26.510
- Great.

436
00:32:26.512 --> 00:32:29.246
Still have that attitude?

437
00:32:29.248 --> 00:32:30.414
All right.

438
00:32:30.416 --> 00:32:32.115
